# Pad script for the harness probe: P1 throws a standing kick (A) in ikemen_saturn.
#
#   scripts/run-emulator.ps1 -Frames 700 -PadScript scripts/pads/ikemen_kick.pad `
#     -Screenshot 380:build/shots/idle.png
#
# The first ~300 frames are asset loading + the round intro, so P1 stays
# idle until 400, then taps A (kick) three times with a gap to let each
# attack finish or the game to hang. Frames are program frames.
